[00:09.980]Nah, you don't know me
{"不 你根本不了解我"}
[00:10.880]Lightning above and a fire below me
{"头顶闪电 脚下烈火"}
[00:13.160]You cannot catch me, cannot hold me
{"你抓不住我 也困不住我"}
[00:15.090]You cannot stop, much less control me
{"你无法阻止 更别想操控我"}
[00:17.150]
[00:17.880]When it rains, it pours
{"祸不单行"}
[00:19.490]When the floodgates open
{"当闸门开启"}
[00:20.340]Brace your shores
{"加固你的堤岸"}
[00:21.450]That pressure don't care when it breaks your doors
{"洪流可不管会冲垮谁的家门"}
[00:23.330]Say it's all you can take
{"你说已到承受极限"}
[00:24.510]Better take some more
{"最好再撑久一点"}
[00:25.790]
[00:27.170]'Cause I know what it's like to test fate
{"我深知试探命运的代价"}
[00:29.250]Had my shoulders pressed with that weight
{"曾肩负千钧重压"}
[00:31.450]Stood up strong in spite of that hate
{"在恶意中傲然挺拔"}
[00:33.560]
[00:35.490]Night gets darkest right before dawn
{"黎明前总有至暗时刻"}
[00:37.860]What don't kill you makes you more strong
{"杀不死你的让你更强大"}
[00:39.760]And I been waitin' for it so long
{"而我已等待太久"}
[00:41.920]The nights go on
{"长夜无尽"}
[00:46.420]Waiting for a light that never comes
{"苦等永不降临的曙光"}
[00:50.260]I chase the sun
{"我追逐太阳"}
[00:54.810]Waiting for a light that never comes
{"苦等永不降临的曙光"}
[00:58.810]
